OL,3,GNEWSASocial media inspiring new
OL,4,Ageneration of bookworms
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial media is used by millions of
OL,7,Fpeople around the world to connect with
OL,8,Ffriends, stay up to date with the
OL,9,Flatest pop culture news and for
OL,10,Fshort-form entertainment, but one
OL,11,Fcorner of the internet is encouraging a
OL,12,Fshift back to a non-digital pastime.
OL,14,FDiscussing books and sharing reviews is
OL,15,Fby no means a new trend, but the social
OL,16,Fmedia movement of BookTok and
OL,17,FBookstagram which emerged in recent
OL,18,Fyears has changed the way people
OL,19,Fshowcase and share their reading
OL,20,Fhabits.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
