OL,3,GNEWSASocial media inspiring new
OL,4,Ageneration of bookworms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BookTok and Bookstagram communities
OL,7,Fon TikTok, Instagram and YouTube are
OL,8,Fmade up of readers, authors and
OL,9,Fcreators who share book-related
OL,10,Fcontent, including reviews, bookshelf
OL,11,Ftours and recommendations.
OL,13,FThe phenomenon has led to viral titles,
OL,14,Fintroduced some people to books and
OL,15,Fhelped others to lower their screen
OL,16,Ftime.
